``Sasamuta Shrine'' is located in {{ill|Ōita Prefecture|Q133924|qid=Q133924}}{{ill|Ōita (city)|Q199609|qid=Q199609}}. {{ill|Shikinaisha|lt=Shikinai Shrine|qid=Q134917286|lt=Shikinaisha}} (Taisha), {{ill|Bungo Province|Q864148|qid=Q864148}}{{ill|Ichinomiya|Q1656379|qid=Q1656379}}. {{ill|Modern system of ranked Shinto shrines|Q712534|qid=Q712534|lt=old shrine rank}} is {{ill|Kokuhei Chūsha|qid=Q134917280|lt=Kokuheichusha}}, and currently it is {{ill|Beppyo shrine|Q10898274|qid=Q10898274}} of {{ill|Association of Shinto Shrines|Q908077|qid=Q908077}}. 

